Option: code-cache-D
Name: Shorter code cache: 5 minutes instead of 1 hour
Does: _headers lets browsers keep css, js and lang files for 5 minutes instead of 1 hour, so a change to js/content.js reaches visitors within minutes. Updates the matching words in js/content.js, README and the checklist.
Answers: d05 (any host that reads _headers)
Conflicts: none
Requires: none
Host: any (no effect on GitHub Pages, which ignores _headers)
Order: 50
After: nothing to rebuild; upload again
Strings: none

